From c7bc7767468c3f5dada442f8fcf05eb6f058c3b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:52:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] MAINTAINERS: add the HiSilicon STB VDH decoder entry

The VDH stateless decoder has no maintainer entry. The driver is a
media-platform driver of this family.

Register the driver with the binding that describes it under
linux-media.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -12233,6 +12233,14 @@ F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clo
 F:	drivers/clk/hisilicon/crg-hi3798mv100.c
 F:	include/dt-bindings/clock/hisilicon,hi3798mv100-*.h
 
+HISILICON STB VDH VIDEO DECODER DRIVER
+M:	David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
+L:	linux-media@vger.kernel.org
+L:	linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/hisilicon,hi3716cv200-vdec.yaml
+F:	drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/histb-vdec/
+
 HISILICON STB VOLTAGE REGULATOR DRIVER
 M:	David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 L:	linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org
